scripts/node_modules/
.env
*.log
.DS_Store
.claude/settings.local.json
# Fetch-layer intermediates (Phase 2A): generated locally and in CI, read by
# later steps in the same job, deliberately never committed.
feed-rss.json
feed-github.json
feed-api.json
feed-web.json
# Normalizer product (Phase 2B): derived from the feeds above on every run.
# Board decision D3 keeps it out of Git — carrying full `text` would grow the
# repo by roughly 280 MB/year (plan §2.2.1).
signals.json
# The full lookback window, undeduplicated (Phase 3). Clustering reads this
# rather than `signals.json`, whose cross-run dedup leaves it holding only the
# delta since the last run.
signals-window.json
# The internal partition (Phase 2C). It is written to $RUNNER_TEMP in CI, so it
# should never reach the working tree at all — this is the second lock, for the
# `git add -A` that someone will eventually run (plan §4.3).
signals-internal.json
